@startuml E-Nagar_Communication_Diagram
'!pragma layout smetana

title E-Nagar Suraksha — Communication Diagram\n(Object Interaction with Numbered Messages)

skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor       #2C3E50
  LifeLineBorderColor #7F8C8D
  ParticipantBorderColor  #2C3E50
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
  ParticipantFontStyle Bold
  NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  NoteBorderColor  #F39C12
  BoxBackgroundColor #F4F6F7
  BoxBorderColor   #BDC3C7
}

' ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' OBJECTS (represented as participants — no Graphviz needed)
' ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

box "Client Side" #E8F4FD
  participant "citizen\n:User"            as citizen
  participant "browser\n:ReactFrontend"   as browser
end box

box "Server Side" #E8F8EF
  participant "api\n:ExpressAPI"          as api
  participant "auth\n:ClerkAuth"          as auth
  participant "router\n:AutoRouter"       as router
  participant "db\n:MongoDB"              as db
end box

box "Notification Layer" #FFF8EE
  participant "notif\n:NotificationSvc"  as notif
  participant "socket\n:SocketIO"        as socket
  participant "officer\n:Officer"        as officer
end box

' ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' FLOW A — Complaint Submission
' ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

== FLOW A: Complaint Submission ==

citizen -> browser : **1:** submitComplaintForm(data, images, location)
browser -> api     : **2:** POST /api/complaints (multipart/form-data)
activate api
api     -> auth    : **3:** verifyToken(JWT)
auth    -> api     : **4:** {userId, role}

api     -> db      : **5:** checkDuplicate(location, keywords)
db      -> api     : **6:** duplicateResult {found | not_found}

note right of api
  If duplicate found →
  return 409 to browser
end note

api     -> db      : **7:** saveComplaint(complaintData)
db      -> api     : **8:** {complaintId, trackingId}

api     -> router  : **9:** route(category)
router  -> api     : **10:** {assignedDept: "police" | "municipal"}

api     -> db      : **11:** updateAssignment(complaintId, deptId)

api     -> notif   : **12:** sendNotification(officerId, complaintId)
notif   -> socket  : **13:** emit("new_complaint", officerId)
socket  -> officer : **14:** push(notificationPayload)

api     -> browser : **15:** {success: true, trackingId}
deactivate api
browser -> citizen : **16:** displayConfirmation(trackingId)

' ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' FLOW B — Complaint Resolution
' ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

== FLOW B: Complaint Resolution ==

officer -> browser : **R1:** clickResolve(complaintId)

note over browser, api
  **Municipal Officer** → proof upload is MANDATORY before resolve
  **Police Officer**    → proof upload is OPTIONAL
end note

browser -> api     : **R2:** POST /api/complaints/:id/proof (proof images)
activate api
api     -> db      : **R3:** saveProofImages(complaintId, fileUrls)
db      -> api     : **R4:** {proofSaved: true}

browser -> api     : **R5:** PUT /api/complaints/:id/update-status\n          {status: "resolved"}
api     -> auth    : **R6:** verifyToken(JWT)
auth    -> api     : **R7:** {valid: true, role}
api     -> db      : **R8:** updateStatus("resolved", resolvedAt: now)
db      -> api     : **R9:** {updated: true}

api     -> notif   : **R10:** notifyResolution(citizenId, complaintId)
notif   -> socket  : **R11:** emit("complaint_resolved", citizenId)
socket  -> citizen : **R12:** push("Your complaint has been resolved ✓")

api     -> browser : **R13:** {success: true, status: "resolved"}
deactivate api

' ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' FLOW C — Status Tracking (Citizen)
' ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

== FLOW C: Citizen Tracks Status ==

citizen -> browser : **T1:** openTrackingPage(trackingId)
browser -> api     : **T2:** GET /api/complaints/search?trackingId=...\n          (public route — no auth required)
activate api
api     -> db      : **T3:** findByTrackingId(trackingId)
db      -> api     : **T4:** {complaint: {status, assignedDept, timeline}}
api     -> browser : **T5:** complaintDetails
deactivate api
browser -> citizen : **T6:** displayStatusTimeline()

@enduml
